WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.959 --> 00:00:06.210
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie and in my Walking
Dead review I asked you to submit all of your

00:00:06.210 --> 00:00:08.990
questions about the wtf fest that went down
as well as the next two episodes.

00:00:08.990 --> 00:00:12.220
I picked 10 to answer in this video and one
bonus questions.

00:00:12.220 --> 00:00:15.840
All things considered, everyone was pretty
much on the same page as far as Lizzie was

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:16.840
concerned.

00:00:16.840 --> 00:00:19.109
But everyone wanted to know about what’s
coming next.

00:00:19.109 --> 00:00:23.029
Before we get in it congratulations to this
week’s giveaway winner, Becky Green you

00:00:23.029 --> 00:00:24.849
win the amazon gift card this week.

00:00:24.849 --> 00:00:26.249
Everybody be sure to give her a high five.

00:00:26.249 --> 00:00:29.330
I’ll be contacting you on your channel for
details.

00:00:29.330 --> 00:00:31.849
Don’t worry if you didn’t win.

00:00:31.849 --> 00:00:36.449
The next round starts Sunday and for the finale
I’m doubling down, so there will be 2 winners.

00:00:36.449 --> 00:00:41.320
And I’ll be doing the same type of giveaway
for Game of Thrones every week too.

00:00:41.320 --> 00:00:44.899
So that’s like 3 solid months of weekly
giveaways.

00:00:44.899 --> 00:00:46.960
On to fun time, let’s answer some questions.

00:00:46.960 --> 00:00:53.850
Number One comes from Decaposaurus who asks
Based on these two deaths, do you think that

00:00:53.850 --> 00:00:57.149
there will still be another major death before
the season ends?﻿

00:00:57.149 --> 00:01:03.200
Yes, based on all the rumors, even the ones
that aren’t super crazy.

00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:06.960
It seems like they’re still building towards
one more death to launch things into season

00:01:06.960 --> 00:01:07.960
5.

00:01:07.960 --> 00:01:12.090
A lot of people are pointing fingers at Daryl
based on the teaser for the next episode.

00:01:12.090 --> 00:01:15.500
He isn’t integrating well into the roving
band of lunatics.

00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:17.530
And they’re making fun of the fact he can’t
find Beth.

00:01:17.530 --> 00:01:19.420
But I think that’s just misdirection.

00:01:19.420 --> 00:01:25.009
I’m not going to call them the Hunters until
I see human flesh go down someone’s throat.

00:01:25.009 --> 00:01:29.159
But that doesn’t mean that once everyone
gets to Terminus, they won’t be responsible

00:01:29.159 --> 00:01:32.400
for whoever dies next.

00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:37.610
My earlier prediction was Maggie, just since
it fit with some of the more logical rumors.

00:01:37.610 --> 00:01:42.210
To be honest, there is no character that I
love so badly I would freak if they died.

00:01:42.210 --> 00:01:45.020
They’re all great, so no matter what we’re
going to feel awful.

00:01:45.020 --> 00:01:51.970
But by all accounts, this season finale won’t
be the shit storm that the season 3 finale

00:01:51.970 --> 00:01:52.970
was.

00:01:52.970 --> 00:01:55.180
They’re not going to do the exact same thing.

00:01:55.180 --> 00:02:00.280
Question 2 - kaosdevice asks Do you think
the fire was from the house Beth and Daryll

00:02:00.280 --> 00:02:01.280
lit up?

00:02:01.280 --> 00:02:03.930
Absolutely, and it didn’t look that far
away.

00:02:03.930 --> 00:02:08.229
They saw it during the day, so this episode
probably took place the day after episode

00:02:08.229 --> 00:02:09.229
12.

00:02:09.229 --> 00:02:12.220
So while all this Lizzie business was going
down, Daryl was in the process of getting

00:02:12.220 --> 00:02:14.040
separated from Beth.

00:02:14.040 --> 00:02:18.890
Question 3 - Mikato Tanaka asks Do you think
that grove will be haunted with the spirits

00:02:18.890 --> 00:02:21.030
of Lizzie and Mica from now on?﻿

00:02:21.030 --> 00:02:25.230
I’m assuming based on your question that
you believe in ghosts.

00:02:25.230 --> 00:02:29.780
So let’s assume they do exist and are capable
of perpetrating hauntings.

00:02:29.780 --> 00:02:33.910
By that logic yes, they are totally haunting
the grove with that other little kid that

00:02:33.910 --> 00:02:35.520
died before they got there.

00:02:35.520 --> 00:02:37.590
At least there’s three of them now.

00:02:37.590 --> 00:02:41.620
Consequently, in most horror movies ghosts
haunt places because they can’t move forward.

00:02:41.620 --> 00:02:47.690
That means Lizzie is still crazy and Mika
is stuck with her for the rest of time.

00:02:47.690 --> 00:02:50.560
Does that mean Mika is stuck in hell?

00:02:50.560 --> 00:02:52.820
I’ll let you guys answer that question.

00:02:52.820 --> 00:02:54.892
My alternate theory for what happened after
they’re going to follow Carol and Tyreese

00:02:54.892 --> 00:02:58.470
around and give them both fever dreams until
they die too.

00:02:58.470 --> 00:03:02.990
Question 4 - Rasengan asks When do you think
Negan will show up?

00:03:02.990 --> 00:03:06.900
Robert Kirkman has been pretty clear that
he wanted a lot of space between The Governor

00:03:06.900 --> 00:03:12.630
and Negan, so I think it will be at least
mid-season 5 before he becomes a recurring

00:03:12.630 --> 00:03:14.400
character.

00:03:14.400 --> 00:03:16.540
I am expecting some teasers in the finale.

00:03:16.540 --> 00:03:21.570
I’m thinking that someone at Terminus might
refer to the Saviors, which is really a Negan

00:03:21.570 --> 00:03:22.570
Teaser.

00:03:22.570 --> 00:03:26.490
But because we haven’t met Gareth yet, it’s
pretty clear that he’ll be the big character

00:03:26.490 --> 00:03:28.030
we’ll meet at terminus.

00:03:28.030 --> 00:03:29.190
For better or worse.

00:03:29.190 --> 00:03:33.950
He’s supposed to be an antagonist, but if
he’s an amalgam of Gabriel and Jesus, he’s

00:03:33.950 --> 00:03:34.950
a good person.

00:03:34.950 --> 00:03:42.770
Both those characters helped the survivors.

00:03:42.770 --> 00:03:49.800
Question 5 - sandraand6690 asks why did dizzy
Lizzie kill her sister?﻿

00:03:49.800 --> 00:03:54.710
Remember when Lizzie said I’ll change myself
and then you’ll understand.

00:03:54.710 --> 00:03:58.830
She was talking about making Mika understand
that the Walkers were people.

00:03:58.830 --> 00:04:02.220
She thought of them the way you would think
about your best friend.

00:04:02.220 --> 00:04:04.440
Not a slowly moving bitey head.

00:04:04.440 --> 00:04:10.360
So I think she thought the best way to quote
unquote, show Mika was to turn her.

00:04:10.360 --> 00:04:11.430
Which is why she said, don’t worry.

00:04:11.430 --> 00:04:14.400
She’ll come back, I didn’t hurt her brain.

00:04:14.400 --> 00:04:18.250
Because hurting the brain is the only way
to kill a walker.

00:04:18.250 --> 00:04:21.949
She was going to turn Judith to make Carol
and Tyreese understand.

00:04:21.949 --> 00:04:23.949
Thank jeebus she did not.

00:04:23.949 --> 00:04:29.940
Question 6 - D95 Parkour asks Since Daryl
was shown in the trailer after the episode,

00:04:29.940 --> 00:04:32.949
do you think we will find out what happened
to Beth next week?

00:04:32.949 --> 00:04:36.669
It seemed like almost everyone was in the
teaser BUT Beth, just based on that it seems

00:04:36.669 --> 00:04:38.889
like they’re holding off that reveal for
the Finale.

00:04:38.889 --> 00:04:44.330
It makes a weird kind of sense for the writers
to hang Beth over our heads for one more week.

00:04:44.330 --> 00:04:48.020
Just making us wonder who kidnapped her, whether
or not she’s alive.

00:04:48.020 --> 00:04:51.889
Add those things to the awfulness that looks
like it’s going to be happening anyway and

00:04:51.889 --> 00:04:55.469
you arrive at the stress level AMC wants you
to be at.

00:04:55.469 --> 00:04:59.789
The way I look at it is that they want everyone
in the world to watch that Finale, and the

00:04:59.789 --> 00:05:03.449
best way to get you to do that is to hold
off on some big questions.

00:05:03.449 --> 00:05:06.610
Namely in this case, Beth.

00:05:06.610 --> 00:05:13.940
The big question next week is what will be
in the teaser trailer for the finale.

00:05:13.940 --> 00:05:19.940
Question 7 - teebaby0486 asks How do you think
rick will handle seeing carol again... will

00:05:19.940 --> 00:05:22.539
tyreese vouch for her because of the things
she had to do?

00:05:22.539 --> 00:05:27.100
And how about Daryl if he comes back how will
he react to carol now?

00:05:27.100 --> 00:05:30.780
Rick will mostly be happy to see Judith again,
so happy that I think he’ll forget about

00:05:30.780 --> 00:05:32.319
the bad blood between them.

00:05:32.319 --> 00:05:36.840
Carol wasn’t pissed when they parted ways,
so they don’t hate each other.

00:05:36.840 --> 00:05:41.449
And even if they did, Rick is probably just
happy to find more familiar faces that survived

00:05:41.449 --> 00:05:43.350
The Governor’s attack.

00:05:43.350 --> 00:05:51.120
So yes, there will probably be an awkward
pause, until the camera pans to Judith and

00:05:51.120 --> 00:05:59.629
then everyone will just break down crying
tears of joy.

00:05:59.629 --> 00:06:03.600
Question 8 - Jamie Lannister asks Do you think
they should've left Lizzie alone with all

00:06:03.600 --> 00:06:04.740
her "friends"?

00:06:04.740 --> 00:06:07.980
I assume you’re talking about after she
killed Mika.

00:06:07.980 --> 00:06:12.560
I think they didn’t just because Carol and
Tyreese still felt responsible for her.

00:06:12.560 --> 00:06:13.560
Especially Carol.

00:06:13.560 --> 00:06:16.870
And even if they did try to abandon her, Lizzie
would have just followed them.

00:06:16.870 --> 00:06:21.259
I think tying her up to a tree or something
would have just been cruel.

00:06:21.259 --> 00:06:25.470
And as much as Mika talked about not wanting
to be bad, then Carol killing Lizzie.

00:06:25.470 --> 00:06:28.550
I don’t think Carol has ever been a bad
person.

00:06:28.550 --> 00:06:29.610
She is a little extreme.

00:06:29.610 --> 00:06:33.340
But remember when she confessed to Rick, she
said there was nothing she wouldn’t do for

00:06:33.340 --> 00:06:34.529
the children.

00:06:34.529 --> 00:06:38.400
Question 9 - Ben Goffrey (no avatar) asks
Do you think carol will eventually kill herself

00:06:38.400 --> 00:06:39.580
with the shame of the "murders" fresh on her
hands?

00:06:39.580 --> 00:06:41.969
In the comics she comes to the point of ending
her own life.

00:06:41.969 --> 00:06:47.470
At this point Carol on the show is so different
from Carol in the comics that I don’t consider

00:06:47.470 --> 00:06:49.220
them to be the same people.

00:06:49.220 --> 00:06:53.340
There are a lot of plot points that happen
differently and psychologically I think Melissa

00:06:53.340 --> 00:06:55.999
McBride’s version is much more in control
of herself.

00:06:55.999 --> 00:07:01.379
She is the opposite of helpless, and sometimes
when people commit suicide, it’s because

00:07:01.379 --> 00:07:02.879
they feel helpless.

00:07:02.879 --> 00:07:09.150
Had she considered it, I think Tyreese’
speech about doing what they have to do, shook

00:07:09.150 --> 00:07:10.340
her out of it.

00:07:10.340 --> 00:07:14.160
She’ll probably start having nightmares
about them just like Tyreese has nightmares

00:07:14.160 --> 00:07:15.160
about Karen though.

00:07:15.160 --> 00:07:20.360
Question 10 - Kiara Ortiz asks which groups
do you think are going to be reunited first?

00:07:20.360 --> 00:07:24.309
So in the teaser we saw Daryl, the Abraham’s
Group and Rick’s Group.

00:07:24.309 --> 00:07:26.930
So they’re all moving toward Terminus at
about the same rate.

00:07:26.930 --> 00:07:31.289
Glenn is the furthest behind, so I think they’ll
run into Rick’s Group first.

00:07:31.289 --> 00:07:36.789
Most of the time the people we see in the
teasers are the only groups the episodes focus

00:07:36.789 --> 00:07:38.029
on.

00:07:38.029 --> 00:07:41.379
So it’s possible that Carol and Tyreese
as well as Beth, won’t show up until the

00:07:41.379 --> 00:07:44.719
finale.

00:07:44.719 --> 00:07:48.839
Since Daryl’s group is moving all over the
place it’s also possible he could stumble

00:07:48.839 --> 00:07:50.779
on Abraham or Rick too.

00:07:50.779 --> 00:07:54.569
It kind of seems like Daryl’s going to have
a tough time quitting his group.

00:07:54.569 --> 00:07:58.999
So it might take some of the other survivors,
like Abraham, to help get rid of Joe and the

00:07:58.999 --> 00:07:59.999
rednecks.

00:07:59.999 --> 00:08:05.129
and one last Bonus Question - Natalie Ellis
asks do you ever think Rick will be killed

00:08:05.129 --> 00:08:06.210
off?

00:08:06.210 --> 00:08:09.469
This is actually a big problem for Robert
Kirkman in the comics.

00:08:09.469 --> 00:08:13.650
There’s a big conflict going on in the comics
called All Out War.

00:08:13.650 --> 00:08:18.400
I think that Kirkman wants to be able to safely
kill off Rick at some point without completely

00:08:18.400 --> 00:08:20.039
enraging the fandom.

00:08:20.039 --> 00:08:25.279
But as a temporary way to sidestep the issue,
they’ve started to feature a different group

00:08:25.279 --> 00:08:26.810
that doesn’t include Rick.

00:08:26.810 --> 00:08:29.699
Just to take the heat off the issue so to
speak.

00:08:29.699 --> 00:08:33.820
So short answer, whatever happens to him,
will probably happen in the comics first.

00:08:33.820 --> 00:08:36.280
Unless Andrew Lincoln the actor, wants off
the show.

00:08:36.280 --> 00:08:40.940
It doesn’t always follow the comic, but
for the people alive, especially this season,

00:08:40.940 --> 00:08:44.270
all the deaths have gone down pretty closely
to the way they happened in the comics.

00:08:44.270 --> 00:08:48.070
So, thank you so much for submitting your
questions, this was a ton of fun.

00:08:48.070 --> 00:08:51.290
And one more high five to Becky for winning
the giveaway this week.

00:08:51.290 --> 00:08:53.660
A lot of you are asking me to start doing
Season 5 videos.

00:08:53.660 --> 00:09:00.280
I’m going to do all of that stuff, but I’m
waiting till we get a little closer to the

00:09:00.280 --> 00:09:01.280
finale.

00:09:01.280 --> 00:09:03.780
There’s still a lot we don’t know about
how this season will end.

00:09:03.780 --> 00:09:05.380
So I just want to wait a little bit.

00:09:05.380 --> 00:09:08.440
Marvel Tuesday is tomorrow.

00:09:08.440 --> 00:09:09.460
So get excited for that.

00:09:09.460 --> 00:09:10.460
There will be new Avengers 2 footage.

00:09:10.460 --> 00:09:14.140
Right now click here for my review of the
episode and click here for the rest of my

00:09:14.140 --> 00:09:17.590
Season 4 predictions.

00:09:17.590 --> 00:09:23.170
Thanks for watching, see you guys tomorrow.

00:09:23.170 --> 00:09:23.370
High fives!

